sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title WF3 - Replay an attempt and view its report (planned design)
    actor Lecturer
    actor Student
    participant UI as React UI
    participant API as ASP.NET API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Store as Object storage

    Note over Lecturer,Store: Planned WF3. Tables exist, but replay/report endpoints and UI are not implemented in M3.
    Lecturer->>UI: Open an exam session
    UI->>API: Request participants for session (proposed)
    API->>DB: Verify Lecturer owns session or actor is Admin
    alt Not authorized
        DB-->>API: No visible session
        API-->>UI: Access denied with no student data
    else Authorized
        DB-->>API: Session and student attempt list
        API-->>UI: Participants and attempt status
        Lecturer->>UI: Select a student attempt
        UI->>API: Request attempt detail (proposed)
        API->>DB: Read questions, answers, transcripts, AI decisions and activity logs
        DB-->>API: Ordered replay timeline
        API-->>UI: Attempt detail
        opt Audio answer exists
            UI->>API: Request authorized playback (proposed)
            API->>Store: Resolve audio object key
            Store-->>API: Short-lived audio access
            API-->>UI: Playback reference
        end
        UI-->>Lecturer: Show replay timeline and AI/follow-up decisions
        Lecturer->>UI: View report and feedback
        UI->>API: Request report for attempt (proposed)
        API->>DB: Read report and lecturer evaluation
        alt Report available
            DB-->>API: Scores and feedback
            API-->>UI: Report DTO
            UI-->>Lecturer: Show report and feedback
        else Report not ready
            DB-->>API: No report yet
            API-->>UI: Explicit pending / not-found state
        end
    end

    Student->>UI: Open own completed attempt
    UI->>API: Request own replay and report (proposed)
    API->>DB: Verify attempt.student_id equals signed-in Student
    alt Own attempt
        DB-->>API: Visible attempt detail and available report
        API-->>UI: Student-safe replay and feedback
        UI-->>Student: Show own session and report
    else Another student's attempt
        DB-->>API: Access denied
        API-->>UI: Access denied with no other student's data
    end
